1. Which specialties generate the highest Medicare payments?

SELECT Rndrng_Prvdr_Type, ROUND(AVG(Avg_Mdcr_Pymt_Amt),2) AS Avg_Payment
FROM medicare_data
GROUP BY Rndrng_Prvdr_Type
ORDER BY Avg_Payment DESC;

2. Which procedures have the largest service volume?

SELECT HCPCS_Cd, HCPCS_Desc,
SUM(Tot_Srvcs) AS Total_Services
FROM medicare_data
GROUP BY HCPCS_Cd, HCPCS_Desc
ORDER BY Total_Services DESC;
